==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Both stages are fairly similar, with the only big difference being Cyberhorn. It's possible to speedrun Chapter 1 if you have [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow]], as you can spam that and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] to easily destroy the base before the LeMurrs cause too much damage. For Chapter 2, use your regular team and you should be fine, However, take extra caution of the LeMurrs and Cyberhorn. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]], [[Voli (Uber Rare Cat)|Volta]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]] or anything else with Alien Knockback, Freeze or Weaken get an honorable mention and will be a big help to you.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Chapter 3 is basically Elder Sloth + peons and LeMurrs. Keep on meatshielding and use longer ranged attackers to chip down the sloth. Rich Cat and all alien treasures up to this point are going to be recommended for this stage, as Elder Sloth does not wait for you to hit the base before spawning and moves about as fast as LeMurr does. An alternate way to do this stage, is to just spam heavy hitters or fast attacking units (eg. Courier Cat) before Elder Sloth spawns. After he spawns continue to send your heavy hitters to destroy the enemy base.

